## SECTION 2 — Product Understanding

**What it is:** A GST-first Indian SMB accounting & billing platform. Covers the full AR/AP lifecycle: quotations → invoices → payments → credit notes on the sales side; vendor bills → goods returns → AP credit memos on the purchase side. Adds inventory, recurring billing, warranty claims, banking/cash ledger, and a rich reports layer (P&L, Balance Sheet, Trial Balance, Aged Receivables, GST Summary).

**Target customer:** Indian MSMEs — manufacturers, distributors, service firms — currently on Tally, spreadsheets, or Vyapar.

**Why they would switch:**
- Modern browser-first UX vs. Tally's 1990s desktop paradigm
- Built-in warranty tracking (unique)
- Procurement analysis dashboard
- Cheap SaaS vs. Tally Prime Gold licensing

**Complete customer journey:**
Register → Create Org → Add Products/Vendors → Raise Quotation → Convert to Invoice → Collect Payment → File GST → Run P&L → Monitor Aged Receivables → Reconcile Bank

