## SECTION 9 — Security Assessment

### Classified Findings

| Severity | Finding | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| **CRITICAL** | JWT fallback secret hardcoded in source | Throw on missing `JWT_SECRET` env var; rotate immediately |
| **CRITICAL** | All report routes unreachable (module.exports before route definitions) | Move export to end of file |
| **CRITICAL** | Rate limiters not applied — brute-force open | Wire `loginLimiter` to auth routes in `server.js` |
| **CRITICAL** | `product_categories`/`price_lists`/`balance_due`/`amount_paid` columns missing — crash on prod | Add migration 006 to create missing columns/tables |
| **HIGH** | Dev bypass credentials hardcoded and publicly visible | Move to env-only, add IP allowlist, remove from source |
| **HIGH** | No CORS configuration | Add `cors()` with explicit origin whitelist |
| **HIGH** | Cookie missing `Secure` flag | `secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production'` |
| **HIGH** | No Helmet.js | Add `helmet()` as first middleware |
| **HIGH** | Zod validators defined but not used on any route | Apply `validate(schema)` middleware to all mutation routes |
| **HIGH** | No input sanitization on free-text fields (notes, description) — XSS vector | DOMPurify on frontend + Zod `.transform()` strip on backend |
| **MEDIUM** | `org_id` taken from JWT — but update routes don't verify ownership on all paths | Add explicit org_id WHERE clause to all UPDATE/DELETE (mostly done, audit remaining) |
| **MEDIUM** | No refresh token / token rotation | Implement short-lived access + refresh token pair |
| **MEDIUM** | Console.log leaks internal error details | Replace with structured logger (pino/winston) |
| **LOW** | Swagger endpoint exposed in production | Gate behind auth or disable in prod |
| **LOW** | `sessions` table unused — ghost artifact | Drop or use properly |

